WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.956
At 2,890 km down, the rock ends.

00:00:05.406 --> 00:00:09.808
Below it is the outer core: liquid
iron and nickel, almost twice as

00:00:09.808 --> 00:00:11.385
dense as the rock above.

00:00:11.835 --> 00:00:14.609
Its slow churning makes the Earth's
magnetic field.

00:00:15.059 --> 00:00:19.012
Shear waves from earthquakes cannot
cross a liquid, and that is how we

00:00:19.012 --> 00:00:20.029
know it is molten.
